---
// Impact — Mentorship, Leadership & Frameworks
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[var(--bg-inverse)] text-[var(--bg-primary)] transition-colors duration-500">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-4">
        Beyond Code
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight">
        Impact
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 md:gap-12 lg:gap-20">
      <!-- Mentorship & Leadership -->
      <div>
        <div class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--text-ghost)] mb-8"></div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium mb-6">
          Mentorship & Leadership
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-faint)]">
          <p>
            Onboarding junior developers into complex codebases. Setting up
            engineering environments that reduce friction and accelerate
            productivity from day one.
          </p>
          <p>
            Leading technical workshops on Python and distributed systems—turning
            hackathons into learning experiences where engineers build confidence
            alongside working prototypes.
          </p>
          <p>
            Engineering leadership is not about writing the most code. It's about
            creating the conditions where others can do their best work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Frameworks & Tooling -->
      <div>
        <div class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--text-ghost)] mb-8"></div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium mb-6">
          Frameworks & Tooling
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-faint)]">
          <p>
            Core contributor to
            <span class="font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)]">Envoxy</span>, a Python
            framework built to solve microservice communication challenges.
            Architected components for uWSGI and message broker integration to
            simplify the development lifecycle for engineering teams.
          </p>
          <p>
            Maintained a high-performance Python SDK for real-time data
            synchronization, bridging the gap between hardware protocols and
            cloud-scale applications.
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-ghost)] pt-4 border-t border-[var(--border-primary)]">
            The best frameworks disappear—they solve the problem so completely that
            engineers forget the complexity was ever there.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
